<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pivot Advisors — Transform Change into Opportunity</title>
<meta name="description" content="Pivot Advisors helps businesses not only adapt, but lead through change. Post-merger integration, fractional executive support, AI consulting, staffing and offshoring solutions.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Questrial&family=Kaushan+Script&family=Sacramento&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --red:#E8473E;
    --red-dark:#C93A32;
    --ink:#0A0A0A;
    --white:#FFFFFF;
    --grey:#F4F4F4;
    --grey-mid:#8A8A8A;
    --display:"Poppins",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --body:"Questrial","Poppins",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --script:"Kaushan Script",cursive;
    --sig:"Sacramento",cursive;
    --pad:24px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:var(--body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);
       font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block}
  .wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad)}

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  .nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(10,10,10,.95);
       backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid #222}
  .nav-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px var(--pad);
          display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;text-decoration:none}
  .brand .p{font-family:var(--sig);font-size:38px;color:var(--red);line-height:.8}
  .brand .a{font-family:var(--body);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.34em;
            color:var(--white);text-transform:uppercase}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .nav-links a{color:#CFCFCF;text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;
               letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--red)}
  .nav-cta{background:var(--red);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;
           padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13.5px;
           letter-spacing:.05em;white-space:nowrap}
  .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--red-dark)}
  .menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}

  /* ---------- shared section ---------- */
  section{position:relative}
  .band{height:16px;background:var(--red)}
  .sec{padding:96px 0}
  .sec-dark{background:var(--ink);color:var(--white)}
  .sec-red{background:var(--red);color:var(--white)}
  .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
           color:var(--red);margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--display)}
  h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);
     line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3}
  .red{color:var(--red)}
  .script{font-family:var(--script);font-weight:400}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{min-height:82vh;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;
        background:linear-gradient(115deg,#1b1b1f 0%,#2e2a27 45%,#4a3f38 100%);
        overflow:hidden}
  .hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
        background:radial-gradient(circle at 72% 38%,rgba(255,222,190,.22),transparent 55%);
        pointer-events:none}
  .hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:110px 0}
  .hero h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;color:#fff;
           font-size:clamp(42px,7.2vw,92px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .hero h1 .red{color:var(--red)}
  .hero p{color:#E6E0DA;font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,21px);margin-top:26px;max-width:52ch}
  .hero-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:38px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:999px;
       font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.04em;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;
       transition:transform .12s,background .15s,color .15s}
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .btn-red{background:var(--red);color:#fff}
  .btn-red:hover{background:var(--red-dark)}
  .btn-ghost{border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.75);color:#fff}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}

  /* ---------- about ---------- */
  .about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start}
  .headshot{border:5px solid var(--red);border-radius:42px;overflow:hidden;
            aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#f0f0f0}
  .headshot img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  .who{text-align:center;margin-top:20px}
  .who .role{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.5}
  .who .name{font-family:var(--sig);font-size:58px;color:var(--red);line-height:1;margin-top:6px}
  .meet{font-family:var(--script);color:var(--red);
        font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,50px);text-align:right;margin-bottom:38px}
  .facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:34px 22px}
  .fact{text-align:center}
  .fact svg{width:52px;height:52px;margin:0 auto 14px;display:block;stroke:var(--ink);
            stroke-width:1.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .fact p{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.35}
  .fact.is-red p{color:var(--red)}
  .fact.is-red svg{stroke:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- results ---------- */
  .res-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}
  .res-top h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,52px);font-weight:500;max-width:12ch}
  .chart{stroke:#fff;stroke-width:7;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;width:100%;height:auto}
  .res-rule{height:1px;background:#555;margin:62px 0 46px}
  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px}
  .stat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}
  .stat b{font-family:var(--display);color:var(--red);font-weight:500;
          font-size:clamp(34px,3.6vw,46px);line-height:1.05;white-space:nowrap}
  .stat p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#E2E2E2}

  /* ---------- solutions ---------- */
  .sol-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:44px 26px;margin-top:56px}
  .sol{text-align:center}
  .sol svg{width:66px;height:66px;margin:0 auto 18px;display:block;
           stroke-width:1.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke:var(--ink)}
  .sol p{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;
         line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--display)}
  .sol.is-red p{color:var(--red)}
  .sol.is-red svg{stroke:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- M&A ---------- */
  .ma-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:30px;align-items:center}
  .ma-q{font-size:clamp(19px,2.4vw,28px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;
        line-height:1.45;max-width:22ch}
  .integration{font-family:var(--script);color:var(--red);
               font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,104px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap}
  .ma-body{margin-top:50px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#DDD;max-width:96ch}
  .ma-cta{margin-top:44px;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);letter-spacing:.02em;
          text-transform:uppercase;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400}
  .ma-cta a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:3px solid var(--red);padding-bottom:4px}
  .ma-cta a:hover{color:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- fractional ---------- */
  .sec-grain{background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.045) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.045) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px),
      #E2E2E2}
  .frac-head{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;text-align:right;
             font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,46px);line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:54px}
  .frac-list{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;
             font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,23px);letter-spacing:.01em;
             text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.6}
  .frac-list p{margin-bottom:30px;max-width:60ch}
  .frac-tag{margin-top:60px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;
            font-size:clamp(14px,1.7vw,19px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase}

  /* ---------- staffing ---------- */
  .staff-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}
  .staff-title{font-family:var(--script);font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,74px);
               color:#fff;line-height:1;margin-bottom:52px}
  .staff-points p{font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,27px);letter-spacing:.02em;
                  text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:38px;line-height:1.3}
  .pills{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}
  .pill{background:var(--red);color:#fff;text-align:center;
        padding:24px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.8vw,20px);
        letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}

  /* ---------- AI ---------- */
  .ai-head{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
           font-size:clamp(28px,4.4vw,50px);line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .ai-head u{color:var(--red);text-decoration-thickness:3px;text-underline-offset:6px}
  .ai-sub{color:var(--red);font-size:clamp(17px,2.2vw,24px);margin-top:20px}
  .ai-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:48px}
  .ai-card{background:var(--red);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:30px 32px}
  .ai-card-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .ai-card-h svg{width:44px;height:44px;flex:0 0 44px;stroke:#0A0A0A;stroke-width:1.8;
                 fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .ai-card h3{font-size:clamp(19px,2.2vw,25px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.2}
  .ai-card p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}
  .ai-foot{text-align:center;margin-top:44px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;
           font-size:clamp(15px,1.9vw,20px);line-height:1.5;max-width:90ch;
           margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}

  /* ---------- offshoring ---------- */
  .off-title{text-align:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:300;
             font-size:clamp(26px,4.4vw,50px);letter-spacing:.01em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .off-rule{height:7px;background:var(--red);border-radius:4px;margin:22px auto 60px;max-width:820px}
  .off-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;
            border:2px solid var(--red);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
  .off-cell{padding:24px 26px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;
            line-height:1.45;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid var(--red);
            display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .off-cell.off-l{border-right:2px solid var(--red)}
  .off-cols .off-cell:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}
  .off-cell u{text-underline-offset:3px}
  .off-h{font-family:var(--script);font-size:clamp(30px,4.6vw,54px);
         text-align:center;color:#fff;margin-bottom:26px}
  .off-heads{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0}
  .off-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .off-col div{padding:24px 26px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;
               line-height:1.45;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid var(--red);
               flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .off-col:first-child div{border-right:2px solid var(--red)}
  .off-col div:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .off-marks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;margin-top:16px;
             font-size:42px;text-align:center;color:#fff}

  /* ---------- tailored ---------- */
  .tailor{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}
  .bulbs{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding-top:10px}
  .bulb{width:46px}
  .bulb .cord{width:2px;background:#1a1a1a;margin:0 auto}
  .bulb .glass{width:46px;height:60px;border-radius:50% 50% 46% 46%;
               background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);box-shadow:inset 0 -6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
  .bulb.on .glass{background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 42px 12px rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
  .bulb .cap{width:22px;height:13px;background:#b9b9b9;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px}
  .tailor h2{font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,46px);line-height:1.25}

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */
  .foot-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}
  .foot-logo{text-align:center}
  .foot-logo .p{font-family:var(--sig);font-size:96px;color:var(--red);line-height:.75}
  .foot-logo .a{font-family:var(--body);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.42em;
                color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:6px}
  .foot-tag{font-size:clamp(22px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.3;color:#fff;font-weight:300}
  .foot-info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,auto);gap:60px;
             justify-content:center;margin-top:90px;text-align:left}
  .foot-info h4{color:var(--red);font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;
                font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  .foot-info a,.foot-info p{color:#EDEDED;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;line-height:1.7}
  .foot-info a:hover{color:var(--red)}
  .copyright{text-align:center;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:13px;margin-top:70px;letter-spacing:.04em}

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
    .headshot{max-width:300px;margin:0 auto}
    .meet{text-align:center}
    .facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .res-top,.staff-grid,.tailor,.ai-grid,.foot-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}
    .sol-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
    .ma-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .integration{text-align:left}
    .frac-head{text-align:left}
    .foot-logo{text-align:left}
  }
  @media (max-width:680px){
    :root{--pad:18px}
    .sec{padding:64px 0}
    .nav-links{display:none}
    .nav-links.open{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;width:100%;padding:16px 0 4px}
    .nav-in{flex-wrap:wrap}
    .menu-btn{display:block}
    .off-cols,.off-heads,.off-marks{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .off-col:first-child div{border-right:0}
    .foot-info{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;justify-content:start}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ================= NAV ================= -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-in">
    <a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="p">Pivot</span><span class="a">Advisors</span></a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#results">Results</a>
      <a href="#solutions">Solutions</a>
      <a href="#fractional">Fractional</a>
      <a href="#staffing">Staffing</a>
      <a href="#ai">AI</a>
      <a href="#offshoring">Offshoring</a>
    </div>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Reach Out</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <!-- Swap the gradient below for your photo: background:url('hero.jpg') center/cover; -->
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <h1>Transform Change<br>into <span class="red">Opportunity.</span></h1>
    <p>Your strategic partner in navigating the ever-evolving landscape of business transformation.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-red" href="#contact">Reach Out Today</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#solutions">See Our Solutions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="band"></div>

<!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="meet">Nice to Meet You...</p>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="headshot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Angie Jordan, Co-Founder and COO of Pivot Advisors"></div>
        <div class="who">
          <p class="role">Co-Founder &amp; COO<br>Pivot Advisors</p>
          <p class="name">Angie Jordan</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="facts">
        <div class="fact is-red">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 11h18"/></svg>
          <p>20+ Years<br>Experience</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="10" r="5"/><path d="M15 14l5 5M4 20c1-3 3.5-4 7-4"/></svg>
          <p>10+ Yrs Executive<br>Leadership</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact is-red">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20V12M10 20V8M16 20v-6"/><path d="M14 7l4-3 3 4"/><circle cx="8" cy="5" r="2.5"/></svg>
          <p>Revenue, CS &amp;<br>Operations</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="8" width="6" height="12"/><rect x="16" y="8" width="6" height="12"/><path d="M9 15c1-2 5-2 6 0"/></svg>
          <p>Sales &amp; Business<br>Development</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 20v-3h12v3M4 20h16"/><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M9 14h6"/></svg>
          <p>Fractional<br>Executive</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact is-red">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="15" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 8c2-3 5-3 6 0M15 16c-2 3-5 3-6 0"/></svg>
          <p>Process Review &amp;<br>Implementation</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="12" width="10" height="7"/><rect x="15" y="9" width="6" height="10"/><path d="M6 12V8h4"/></svg>
          <p>Ad-Tech, Media,<br>Mar-Tech</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact is-red">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="8" height="14"/><rect x="13" y="10" width="8" height="10"/><path d="M6 10h2M6 14h2M16 14h2"/></svg>
          <p>NYC &amp;<br>Little Rock, AR</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= RESULTS ================= -->
<section class="sec sec-dark" id="results">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="res-top">
      <h2>We help businesses not only <span class="red">adapt</span> &ndash; but <span class="red">lead</span> through change.</h2>
      <svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 300 180" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M20 10v150h260"/>
        <path d="M45 150V95M110 150V70M175 150V50"/>
        <path d="M40 140L105 95 150 108 250 30"/>
        <path d="M228 28h26v26"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="res-rule"></div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <b>20%<br>15%</b>
        <p>Mid-Size Media Firm cited 20% increase in overall operational efficiency + 15% increase in recognized revenue in month</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <b>30%+<br>75%</b>
        <p>A multidisciplinary Medical Firm cited 30%+ lift in patient volume and a 75% increase in web traffic in less than 3 months!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <b>200%+</b>
        <p>Fortune 500 Media Company cited 200%+ increase in revenue from previously stagnant revenue</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="band"></div>

<!-- ================= SOLUTIONS ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="solutions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Solutions</h2>
    <div class="sol-grid">
      <div class="sol">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="7" width="7" height="14"/><rect x="15" y="7" width="7" height="14"/><path d="M10 15c1.5-2.5 2.5-2.5 4 0"/></svg>
        <p>Post Merger &amp;<br>Acquisition Integration</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sol is-red">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="8" cy="7" r="3"/><path d="M3 20c0-3 2.5-5 5-5s5 2 5 5"/><rect x="14" y="9" width="8" height="6" rx="1"/></svg>
        <p>Fractional Executive<br>Support</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sol">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="16" cy="6" r="2"/><path d="M3 20c1-5 4-7 9-7s8 2 9 7"/></svg>
        <p>People Management &amp;<br>Executive Coaching</p>
